{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "fbd34a394961de4df2dc8a84c51d051b88c0d9d26c5737793a7a33df864d4e52", "ja": "心の赴くままに", "zh": "随心所欲", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "63b2f170bee61bee24024fef2414288f2b4896d421fb80956217855a03a6b66d", "ja": "事件後、行方を晦ませていたシャインナイト\nから通信が。借りを返すまで怪盗を続けると\n告げ、一同が次のターゲットにしようとして\nいたお宝を見せびらかす。先をこされた月兎\n隊は、急いで彼女を追いかけるのだった。", "zh": "事件后，销声匿迹的Shine Knight\n发来了联络。她告知众人，在还清人情之前会继续当怪盗，\n并炫耀起大家正打算作为下一个目标的宝物。被她抢先一步的月兔\n队，只得赶紧追了上去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "a00fa8ff82ca2cccd94fb5aac4e29233bad5f9671080a230546a331cb7120b92", "ja": "地下オークション　数日後……", "zh": "地下拍卖会　数日后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "7073406ea4bace55dd8153bc5d3fa2acc2f9fd25a1860d45148dd81f72408f88", "ja": "む～ん。見つかりませんな～……。", "zh": "嗯～。还是找不到呢～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "b6ece74c4cdcc353ea4ab5c1945942353959b58abc764c438efe58c33f9214c8", "ja": "それって、この間のオークションの記事よね。\nなにか進展あった？", "zh": "那是前阵子那场拍卖会的报道吧。\n有进展吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "3030135d791bf60b9d9a4ad8f84ac46796475f5cde370a9a5b97a818b441a8bd", "ja": "はい～。地下オークションのマスターは、悪事の証拠を\n押さえられて、刑務所に入れられたようです～。", "zh": "是的～。地下拍卖的主谋似乎被掌握了作恶的证据，已经被关进监狱了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "cc8a0fde2bed5549e3df01755d2da0e7d74a9e8957dde89d552c9f55e9651f11", "ja": "私が探していたのは、怪盗シャインナイトの\n記事なんですが……今日も見つかりませんでした～。", "zh": "我一直在找的，是关于怪盗闪耀骑士的报道……今天也没找到呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "2b0ab3ea565cd2b5b3c4f849127aecfd3bd104f8469a0d7116e53f24ecf9b79a", "ja": "シャインナイト、オークションの事件の\n直後に姿をくらまして、そのままだもんね。", "zh": "闪耀骑士在拍卖会事件后就销声匿迹了，一直没再出现呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "8fbd317efdce900bd8fc0c420e347015ba4435a0b0fc33171ab9bb30db1fe406", "ja": "腕はまだまだだけど、根性はあると思ってたのに……。", "zh": "虽然实力还差得远，但我本来以为她很有毅力的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "e6d03cc50bc8ee1c4aabe6d7095619a6c6967cb0cef8f62b58e3bfc47aa44dc5", "ja": "リトルにとっては、初めての後輩でしたからね～。\n思い入れもひとしお、ということですな～。", "zh": "对小家伙来说，这是第一个后辈嘛～。\n所以格外有感情，也是理所当然的啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "ffc391bd83a47240f28d2f54d1f1c05d98d4753841495e9ac659cf998564faf0", "ja": "べ、別に、そんなんじゃないし。\n人手が減ると、効率が悪いなってだけ。", "zh": "才、才不是那样呢。\n只是觉得人手少了，效率会变差而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "7758f995a02267bab2989abe370b43dc7fc52e8d148b1bdcf698e5d1e0577718", "ja": "ふふふ、そうですね～。でも本当に、\nどこにいってしまったんでしょうか～……。", "zh": "呵呵呵，是啊～不过真的，\n到底去哪儿了呢～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "12449674f528b06837d1b025c6d3f935ae07e57afdaba92dc1c207c6fbb5cf1f", "ja": "あのダイヤを手に入れて、怪盗を続ける理由が\nなくなったのかもしれないわ。いいことじゃない。", "zh": "说不定拿到那颗钻石后，她就没有继续当怪盗的理由了。不是件好事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "dee27fd6a53fcb9152ad90151c0a193907c2f734128e7697c7ef7faa78fba8fb", "ja": "私たちは私たちで、次の仕事をするだけ！\nミス・W、映像を出してちょうだい。", "zh": "我们就做我们该做的，接下来的工作继续进行就好！\nW小姐，把影像调出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "453665ba587c4b61cf95405de25c20b30fdbd0eb742f0baede000a80b43d5b6f", "ja": "かしこまりました。\n次のターゲットは……あら？", "zh": "明白了。\n下一个目标是……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "46b58ce43817225825d6945e28ad2529ba39065a50ee60957f44cfe70ef41e1e", "ja": "あ、もしもーし！　聞こえてます？\nみなさん、お元気ですか～？", "zh": "啊，喂——！听得到吗？\n大家最近还好吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "bfce5749cfa49f7d37e9a1f81ee6fd47d2c7682e324fe1aebacfe12dd24f0a53", "ja": "シャインナイト！？\nあんた、怪盗はもうやめたんじゃ……。", "zh": "闪耀骑士！？  \n你不是已经不当怪盗了吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "949be74c42fcf2a4a4e9e81aa41a7df9ef588310a7a53fab1416f76ce1431c93", "ja": "え？　あれ？\n私、怪盗やめたなんて言いましたっけ！？", "zh": "诶？咦？\n我有说过自己已经不当怪盗了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "9a574bf47cdf00b3b93d51612fce012cd3aa42865a30ece5b535abda73e42a51", "ja": "レディ・Iがそう言っただけで、\nシャインナイトは言ってはない……かも。", "zh": "只是淑女I那么说了，闪耀骑士可没这么说过……大概。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "eb636a5a53fd2b799c40539c88dce971281d8c938f3ad2febb98d0195a43dce5", "ja": "ですよね！　よかった～、ビックリした♪", "zh": "就是嘛！太好了～吓我一跳♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "7e4babcaf44b3934c0ead83c97d4ad7df223fa8e66b12a8ccea616cec63542d1", "ja": "それで、通信電波をジャックしてまで、\n私たちに何の御用ですか？　シャインナイト。", "zh": "那么，您甚至不惜劫持通讯信号，到底有什么事要找我们呢？闪耀骑士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "08e2aa86b63ca413b84dd88fcbfb9c56ef1dde60cf5317b1ac891e507aaa807e", "ja": "あ、はい！　私、レディ・I先輩に『自分の価値は\n自分で決める』って言われて、気づいたんです！", "zh": "啊，对！雷迪·I前辈对我说：“自己的价值要由自己决定。”我这才意识到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "928d65f7ea3dc4eb62a63c9ebed737e86dedd834c0353b43285899d8be8a9cfc", "ja": "それに、何かを借りたままなんてイヤなので。\nだから返せるまで、怪盗続けます！", "zh": "而且，我不想一直欠着什么不还。\n所以，在能够还回去之前，我会继续当怪盗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "04bd2edda589f72be6818881caab9f147d17df671ea33629e09e8bdd5dd6aa72", "ja": "お～。それは、なによりですな～。", "zh": "哦～那可真是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "38d1fa459d1c2c46aeb76cff1dbeab0e517703e99b39c00cdfaf8458c6ebcc02", "ja": "ふうん？　かかってくるなら好きにすればいいわ。\nそう簡単にいくほど、私たちは甘くないけど。", "zh": "哦？想来挑战的话，随你的便。\n不过，我们可没那么好对付。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "764aea8ceffa61352a81ae9b3e710c27217a0991d2d7b4f2b51578a7421ffd6a", "ja": "そうですか？\nでも今日の勝負は、私の勝ちだと思いますよ！", "zh": "是吗？\n不过，我觉得今天这场对决是我赢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1024_052kao", "source_sha256": "af3a5d7d3297485117d52e16a902967a973a39ffdf98ec96cea2ee8ac12163e4", "ja": "今日の勝負……？\nあっ、それは！？", "zh": "今天的胜负……？\n啊，那是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "4e151ac7d2e07a44f4e5ce610b02f7063caa3cafc7ce5646dbdd48275d55fb0b", "ja": "月の宝は、怪盗シャインナイトが頂戴しました！\nそれではみなさん、ごきげんよう♪", "zh": "月之宝物，已由怪盗闪耀骑士笑纳啦！\n那么大家，再见咯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "3c16fc144eca000d6940cefd2281b1c72bc60db5845e10e297a2d99654ec9a98", "ja": "なんと～、月兎隊より先を行くとは……。\nいつのまにか腕をあげたようですな～。", "zh": "没想到～，竟然赶在月兔队前面了……。\n不知不觉间，身手见长了啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0200_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0200_story_04_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "935137f627976cb5807449d7788bf3151e0a5d7b96eee7195df16e55b075e7fa", "ja": "感心してる場合！？　あんたたち！　今すぐ\n準備しなさい！　月兎レディ……ミッションスタート！", "zh": "还有心思佩服！？你们几个！现在马上准备！月兔淑女……任务开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
